---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Welded Wire Mesh Fence Panels — 3D Fence, Prices & Specs" description="3D welded fence panels and fence systems from Anping factories: heights, wire gauges, coatings, posts and gates. Direct factory pricing.">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <article class="flex-1 min-w-0 prose">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-theme-primary">Welded Wire Mesh Fence Panels</h1>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary">3D fence panels (curved/welded mesh fence) are the world's default security and perimeter fence: a welded mesh panel with V-shaped bends for rigidity, mounted on square or peach-shaped posts. Anping is the largest production cluster — most "European fence" and "3D panel fence" sold globally is made here.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Standard specifications</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Height (mm)</th><th>Panel width</th><th>Opening (mm)</th><th>Wire (mm)</th><th>Post</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>1030</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 200</td><td>3.0–4.0</td><td>48 × 1.5 mm round / 50×50 square</td></tr>
          <tr><td>1230</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 200</td><td>3.5–4.5</td><td>60 × 2.0 mm round / 60×60 square</td></tr>
          <tr><td>1530</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 200</td><td>4.0–5.0</td><td>60 × 2.0 mm round / 60×60 square</td></tr>
          <tr><td>1830</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 200</td><td>4.5–5.0</td><td>60 × 2.5 mm round / 60×60 square</td></tr>
          <tr><td>2030</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 150</td><td>5.0</td><td>60 × 2.5 mm round / 80×80 square</td></tr>
          <tr><td>2430</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 150</td><td>5.0</td><td>80 × 3.0 mm round / 80×80 square</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Coatings</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Galvanized + polyester powder coated</strong> (RAL 6005 green, 7016 anthracite, 9005 black) — the standard, 10–15 year warranty outdoors</li>
        <li><strong>Hot-dip galvanized only</strong> — silver, for utility/agricultural use</li>
        <li>Total coating system usually 100–130 µm; ask for coating thickness test report on first order</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Complete system components</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Panels (with the bends — usually 2, 3 or 4 per panel)</li>
        <li>Posts + caps, with welded brackets or clamp bars</li>
        <li>Clamps/bolts, post caps, and sometimes razor wire brackets</li>
        <li>Gates: single leaf 1.0–1.5 m, double leaf up to 6 m — match the panel coating</li>
      </ol>
      <p>Quote the <strong>full system per linear meter</strong>, not panels alone — posts and fittings are 30–40% of project cost.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Price reference</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Product</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Spec</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Price Range (USD/panel)</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">MOQ</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Lead Time</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">3D panel, 1.03m height</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×200mm, 3.5mm wire, RAL6005</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$8–14/panel</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 panels</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–20 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">3D panel, 1.53m height</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×200mm, 4.0mm wire, RAL6005</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$12–18/panel</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 panels</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–20 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">3D panel, 1.83m height</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×200mm, 4.5mm wire, RAL7016</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$15–22/panel</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 panels</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–25 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">358 anti-climb mesh</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">76.2×12.7mm, 4.0mm wire</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$45–75/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20–30 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Post (1.53m, 60×60mm)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">2.0mm wall, coated</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$8–12/post</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 posts</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–20 days</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted mb-6">*Indicative 2025–2026 ranges. Actual pricing depends on wire cost, coating system, order volume, and destination port. Always request formal quotes with full system breakdown.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">FAQ</h2>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">How much does a 3D fence panel cost FOB?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Very roughly, USD 8–15 per panel for 1.53 m height powder-coated, depending on wire diameter and order size. Container loads (500+ panels) get the best rate.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">What's the loading quantity per container?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">A 40'HC holds roughly 700–900 panels of 1.53 m height (packed on steel pallets) plus posts. Ask the factory for a loading plan.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">Does it meet security standards?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Standard 3D fence is a deterrent, not anti-cut. For high security ask for anti-climb 358 mesh (76.2 × 12.7 mm, 4 mm wire) — also made in Anping.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">What color options are available?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Standard RAL colors: 6005 (moss green), 7016 (anthracite grey), 9005 (black), 9010 (white), 8017 (brown). Custom RAL colors available with longer lead time and possible minimum order.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">How do I install 3D fence panels?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Posts are set in concrete (typically 30–40 cm deep). Panels attach with clamp bars or welded brackets using M8 bolts. Allow 5–10 cm gap below panel for ground clearance. Most suppliers provide installation drawings.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">What's the difference between 2D and 3D fence panels?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary"><strong>3D panels:</strong> V-shaped bends along the length for rigidity, lighter wire (3.5–5mm), most common. <strong>2D panels:</strong> flat with thicker wire (5–8mm), stronger but heavier and more expensive. 3D is standard for most commercial/residential; 2D for high-security or heavy-duty applications.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">How do I plan a container shipment for fence panels?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Use our <a href="/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent">container loading calculator</a> — select "Fence Panels" product type, enter dimensions and quantity. Panels are usually packed on steel pallets or in bundles with metal straps.</p>
      </details>

      <div class="not-prose mt-8 bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="font-semibold text-lg">Get quotes from Anping fence factories</p>
        <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block mt-3 accent-bg hover:accent-bg font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors">Send an inquiry →</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <aside class="lg:w-80 shrink-0">
      <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
        <!-- Quick Tools -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">QUICK TOOLS</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Calculate & Convert</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/tools/welded-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Weight Calculator
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Container Loading
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/tools/fob-price-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> FOB Price Calculator
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/charts/mesh-size-chart/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Mesh Size Chart
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Specs -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">QUICK SPECS</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Fence Panel Standards</h3>
          <dl class="space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Height</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">1.03–2.43 m</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Panel Width</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">2.5 / 3.0 m</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Opening</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">50×150<br/>50×200 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Wire Diameter</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">3.0–5.0 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Coating</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">Zn + Powder<br/>100–130 µm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Colors</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">RAL 6005/7016<br/>9005/9010</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <!-- Related Products -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">RELATED</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Related Products</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/products/welded-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Welded Wire Mesh
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/products/stainless-steel-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Stainless Steel Mesh
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/products/gabion-baskets/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Gabion Baskets
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Base>
